message: "If you use this archive, please cite it as below."
title: "Reproduction archive for a doubly slotted annulus operator for magnetic equivalent circuits (Paper II)"
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "1.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/il1996/doubly-slotted-annulus-IM"
url: "https://github.com/il1996/doubly-slotted-annulus-IM/releases/tag/v1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
abstract: >-
  Complete reproduction archive for the paper "A Doubly Slotted Annulus Operator
  for Magnetic Equivalent Circuits: Trace Conformity, the Slot-Opening Condition,
  and a Finite-Element Verification of the Slotting Ratio on an 18.5 kW Cage
  Induction Machine". Contains the MATLAB package and scripts of the performance
  network for the 18.5 kW cage induction machine, the execution transcripts from
  which every published value originates, the ANSYS Maxwell 2D exports used as
  the reference, the independent Python chain of the linear operator, of the
  finite-element solutions of the slotting ratio and of the slot-cavity
  admittances, the numerical no-load test, and the scripts that generate every
  figure and table.
